Route25_Text_JoeyIntro::
    .string "Local trainers practice\n"
    .string "here.\p"
    .string "Fewer come now.\p"
    .string "Something about this\n"
    .string "cape makes them\p"
    .string "uncomfortable.$"

Route25_Text_JoeyDefeat::
    .string "You're not uncomfortable.$"

Route25_Text_JoeyPostBattle::
    .string "Every POKéMON has\n"
    .string "a weakness.\p"
    .string "So does every place.$"

Route25_Text_DanIntro::
    .string "My father took\n"
    .string "me to a party\p"
    .string "on the S.S. ANNE.\p"
    .string "Everyone there looked\n"
    .string "worried.\p"
    .string "No one said why.$"

Route25_Text_DanDefeat::
    .string "I'm not mad.$"

Route25_Text_DanPostBattle::
    .string "The trainers on\n"
    .string "that ship came\p"
    .string "from everywhere.\p"
    .string "They all had\n"
    .string "the same expression.$"

Route25_Text_FlintIntro::
    .string "I'm cool.\n"
    .string "I've got a girlfriend.\p"
    .string "She told me\n"
    .string "not to come\p"
    .string "here anymore.\p"
    .string "I came anyway.$"

Route25_Text_FlintDefeat::
    .string "She was right.$"

Route25_Text_FlintPostBattle::
    .string "She's always right.\p"
    .string "I'll go back now.$"

Route25_Text_KelseyIntro::
    .string "My boyfriend is\n"
    .string "out here somewhere.\p"
    .string "He went ahead\n"
    .string "to see the cape.\p"
    .string "He hasn't come back.$"

Route25_Text_KelseyDefeat::
    .string "You're better than him.$"

Route25_Text_KelseyPostBattle::
    .string "I'll wait a\n"
    .string "little longer.$"

Route25_Text_ChadIntro::
    .string "I had a\n"
    .string "feeling I had\p"
    .string "to battle you.\p"
    .string "Like something put\n"
    .string "you in my path.$"

Route25_Text_ChadDefeat::
    .string "It knew too.$"

Route25_Text_ChadPostBattle::
    .string "If your POKéMON\n"
    .string "gets confused switch it out.\p"
    .string "Something here confuses everything.$"

Route25_Text_HaleyIntro::
    .string "My friend has\n"
    .string "many cute POKéMON.\p"
    .string "I'm jealous.\p"
    .string "Bill has POKéMON\n"
    .string "I've never seen.\p"
    .string "I'm not jealous\n"
    .string "of those.$"

Route25_Text_HaleyDefeat::
    .string "Not jealous anymore.$"

Route25_Text_HaleyPostBattle::
    .string "You came from\n"
    .string "MT. MOON?\p"
    .string "Don't bring what\n"
    .string "followed you here.$"

Route25_Text_FranklinIntro::
    .string "I came down from\n"
    .string "MT. MOON.\p"
    .string "Something followed me\n"
    .string "out of the cave.\p"
    .string "I've been trying\n"
    .string "to lose it\p"
    .string "since yesterday.$"

Route25_Text_FranklinDefeat::
    .string "Still following.$"

Route25_Text_FranklinPostBattle::
    .string "Don't linger in\n"
    .string "MT. MOON.\p"
    .string "Things attach themselves\n"
    .string "to you in the dark.$"

Route25_Text_NobIntro::
    .string "I'm going to\n"
    .string "see a collection\p"
    .string "at the cape.\p"
    .string "I heard it\n"
    .string "includes something rare.\p"
    .string "Rarer than POKéMON.$"

Route25_Text_NobDefeat::
    .string "You got me good.$"

Route25_Text_NobPostBattle::
    .string "Bill collects things\n"
    .string "most people can't\p"
    .string "identify.\p"
    .string "I'm curious what\n"
    .string "he found recently.$"

Route25_Text_WayneIntro::
    .string "Going to see Bill?\p"
    .string "He's been alone\n"
    .string "out there for weeks.\p"
    .string "No one visits anymore.$"

Route25_Text_WayneDefeat::
    .string "You made it.$"

Route25_Text_WaynePostBattle::
    .string "The trail below\n"
    .string "goes back to CERULEAN.\p"
    .string "Some people take\n"
    .string "it running.$"

Route25_Text_SeaCottageSign::
    .string "SEA COTTAGE\n"
    .string "Bill lives here.\p"
    .string "The water has\n"
    .string "been watching this place.$"

Route25_Text_MistyHighHopesAboutThisPlace::
    .string "This cape used\n"
    .string "to be a\p"
    .string "famous date spot.\p"
    .string "MISTY still comes here.\p"
    .string "Alone now.\p"
    .string "She stares at\n"
    .string "the water for hours.$"

Route25_Text_AreYouHereAlone::
    .string "Are you here alone?\p"
    .string "Be careful at\n"
    .string "the water's edge.\p"
    .string "Something has been\n"
    .string "pulling things in.$"

